===Seashore House===
The hut on the beach's west side is known as the Seashore House, where refreshments are sold to thirsty beachgoers. Defeat all three Trainers inside, then speak to the owner, Mr. Sea. He rewards your effort with a free six-pack of [[Soda Pop]]! From this point on, you can also buy individual bottles for {{pdollar}}300 each.
{{-}}

