===Slateport Market===
The open-air {{DL|Slateport City|Slateport Market}} in the southwest part of town hosts numerous vendors peddling rare goods.

====Doll shop====
The shopkeeper in the {{DL|Slateport City|Doll shop|southwest stall}} offers several different [[Pokémon doll]]s for sale.

